Sally buys one small pizza at $8 and one family-size pizza that costs 3 times as much as the small pizza! How much does she spend in all?,Sally buys one small pizza at $8 and one family-size pizza that costs 3 times as much as the small pizza. How much does she spend in all?,32,32,32,32,"Step 1: Identify the cost of the small pizza.  
