A pet shop had 6 cages of rodents. 3 of the cages have 10hamsters and the other 3 have 5 guinea pigs. How many rodents did the pet shop have in total?,A pet shop had 6 cages of rodents. 3 of the cages have 10 hamsters and the other 3 have 5 guinea pigs. How many rodents did the pet shop have in total?,45,45,45,45,"To solve the problem step by step:

