"Andrew bakes 200 mini cinnamon rolls, and 300 mini blueberry muffins. A normal cinnamon roll has 600 calories and a normal blueberry muffin has 450 calories. If a mini pastry has 1/3rd of the calories of a normal version, how many calories do the pastries he baked have?","Andrew bakes 200 mini cinnamon rolls and 300 mini blueberry muffins. A normal cinnamon roll has 600 calories and a normal blueberry muffin has 450 calories. If a mini pastry has 1/3rd of the calories of a normal version, how many calories do the pastries he baked have?",85000,85000,850,850,"To solve this problem, we will calculate the total calories for the mini cinnamon rolls and mini blueberry muffins separately, then add them together.

### Step 1: Determine the calories in one mini cinnamon roll
A normal cinnamon roll has 600 calories. A mini cinnamon roll has 1/3rd of the calories of a normal cinnamon roll:
\[
\text{Calories in one mini cinnamon roll} = \frac{600}{3} = 200 \, \text{calories}.
\]

### Step 2: Calculate the total calories for all mini cinnamon rolls
Andrew bakes 200 mini cinnamon rolls. The total calories for all mini cinnamon rolls is:
\[
\text{Total calories for mini cinnamon rolls} = 200 \times 200 = 40,000 \, \text{calories}.
\]

### Step 3: Determine the calories in one mini blueberry muffin
A normal blueberry muffin has 450 calories. A mini blueberry muffin has 1/3rd of the calories of a normal blueberry muffin:
\[
\text{Calories in one mini blueberry muffin} = \frac{450}{3} = 150 \, \text{calories}.
\]

### Step 4: Calculate the total calories for all mini blueberry muffins
Andrew bakes 300 mini blueberry muffins. The total calories for all mini blueberry muffins is:
\[
\text{Total calories for mini blueberry muffins} = 300 \times 150 = 45,000 \, \text{calories}.
\]

### Step 5: Calculate the total calories for all pastries
The total calories for all the pastries Andrew baked is the sum of the calories for the mini cinnamon rolls and the mini blueberry muffins:
\[
\text{Total calories} = 40,000 + 45,000 = 85,000 \, \text{calories}.
\]

